  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:maran_divishmaya/captive">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/1"/>Master in heaven, we beseech You,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/2"/>as a captive implores his captor.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/3"/>All captives
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/4"/>are ransomed with money,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/5"/>but Your people Israel [are redeemed]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/6"/>through compassion and supplication.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/7"/>Grant our petition and our request,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/8"/>that we not return empty-handed
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/captive/9"/>from before You.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
